  "milestoneAlcohol14Body": "Liver fat measurably drops, inflammation markers fall.",
  "milestoneAlcohol14Title": "Day 14 — the liver recovers",
  "milestoneAlcohol1Body": "Blood sugar and sleep are still all over the place. Drink a lot, go to bed early.",
  "milestoneAlcohol1Title": "Day 1 — the body starts clearing up",
  "milestoneAlcohol30Body": "Markedly better liver values, a few kilos down on average, visibly calmer skin.",
  "milestoneAlcohol30Title": "Day 30 — skin, sleep, weight",
  "milestoneAlcohol3Body": "REM sleep comes back. You wake up less often at night.",
  "milestoneAlcohol3Title": "Day 3 — sleep gets deeper",
  "milestoneAlcohol7Body": "No residual alcohol. Concentration and mood stabilise.",
  "milestoneAlcohol7Title": "Week 1 — a clear head in the morning",
  "milestoneAlcohol90Body": "The craving is no longer a daily negotiation. Blood pressure and immune system benefit for good.",
  "milestoneAlcohol90Title": "Day 90 — the new normal",
  "milestoneDopamine1Body": "You will want to reach for your phone hundreds of times. That is the habit, not you.",
  "milestoneDopamine1Title": "Day 1 — reaching for the phone",
  "milestoneDopamine21Body": "The automatic hand movement in a queue disappears.",
  "milestoneDopamine21Title": "Day 21 — the reflex is gone",
  "milestoneDopamine3Body": "Boredom is not a bug. It is the state ideas come from.",
  "milestoneDopamine3Title": "Day 3 — boredom comes back",
  "milestoneDopamine60Body": "Two focused hours on one thing are normal again.",
  "milestoneDopamine60Title": "Day 60 — deep work",
  "milestoneDopamine7Body": "You can sit through longer texts and longer conversations without looking away.",
  "milestoneDopamine7Title": "Week 1 — attention span grows",
  "milestoneGeneric21Body": "The decision costs less than it did last week.",
  "milestoneGeneric21Title": "Day 21 — automation begins",
  "milestoneGeneric3Body": "The novelty bonus is gone. Now the habit decides.",
  "milestoneGeneric3Title": "Day 3 — the first real test",
  "milestoneGeneric66Body": "On average a behaviour takes 66 days to run automatically. You are there.",
  "milestoneGeneric66Title": "Day 66 — habit",
  "milestoneNicotine14Body": "Up to 30% better lung function; stairs get easier.",
  "milestoneNicotine14Title": "Day 14 — lungs work better",
  "milestoneNicotine1Body": "After 12 hours CO levels are normal and oxygen rises.",
  "milestoneNicotine1Title": "Day 1 — carbon monoxide gone",
  "milestoneNicotine3Body": "Physical withdrawal peaks. It gets easier from here.",
  "milestoneNicotine3Title": "Day 3 — nicotine is out",
  "milestoneNicotine90Body": "Coughing and shortness of breath drop markedly.",
  "milestoneNicotine90Title": "Day 90 — cilia recovered",
  "milestoneNoFap14Body": "If you feel flat and empty: that is a known phase and it passes.",
  "milestoneNoFap14Title": "Day 14 — flatline possible",
  "milestoneNoFap30Body": "Fewer intrusive thoughts, more presence in everyday life.",
  "milestoneNoFap30Title": "Day 30 — the head gets quieter",
  "milestoneNoFap3Body": "Restlessness and irritability are normal. Movement helps more than willpower.",
  "milestoneNoFap3Title": "Day 3 — the first wave",
  "milestoneNoFap7Body": "More drive, often better sleep too.",
  "milestoneNoFap7Title": "Week 1 — energy rises",
  "milestoneNoFap90Body": "The classic reboot mark. From here it is lifestyle, not a fight.",
  "milestoneNoFap90Title": "Day 90 — the reboot",
  "milestoneSugar14Body": "Fruit suddenly tastes sweet. That is the sensor coming back.",
  "milestoneSugar14Title": "Day 14 — taste recalibrates",
  "milestoneSugar2Body": "Headaches and cravings peak here. Protein and water.",
  "milestoneSugar2Title": "Day 2 — sugar withdrawal",
  "milestoneSugar30Body": "Face and belly look flatter, inflammation markers drop.",
  "milestoneSugar30Title": "Day 30 — less water retention",
  "milestoneSugar5Body": "No more afternoon slump, because the blood sugar rollercoaster is gone.",
